      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL SAINT (5) flew the lids with a fast early split and went on to clock 19.74 when a 2.5 lengths winner over 352m at this track. Looks the testing material. CHRISTMAS DAY (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Q Straight behind Oscar Bravo (19.37) in a Grade 4. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. SPRING NICK (2) missed the frame latest when sixth at Q Straight (19.14) but scored four back at this track (20.01). Has a good record here at this journey. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. GRANDIOSE GIRL (3) was out of placings last time (20.05) at this track in a Grade 3/4, finishing seventh and beaten 5.5 lengths. Has two wins already from this draw.",
